From e970713aa960d0fe89f14a224be3c11050582d93 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 00:12:27 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] v3.1.8: stamp EXTENDNO for the test build

Version stamp only. The build lib resets version.conf to HEAD as its clean
baseline, so an uncommitted bump is reverted and the image would be stamped
v3.1.7 while carrying the v3.1.8 work.

The v3.1.8 feature work itself stays uncommitted and still reaches the image:
make reads the working tree live.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 release/src-rt/version.conf | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/release/src-rt/version.conf b/release/src-rt/version.conf
index a35bf2c96b..18c1e0a883 100644
--- a/release/src-rt/version.conf
+++ b/release/src-rt/version.conf
@@ -4,6 +4,6 @@ KERNEL_VER_AM=$(subst .,,$(KERNEL_VER))
 FS_VER_AM=$(subst .,,$(FS_VER))
 
 SERIALNO=102.8
-EXTENDNO=Reaper_v3.1.7
+EXTENDNO=Reaper_v3.1.8
 
 RCNO=0
-- 
2.25.1

